      "notes": [
        {
          "id": 549105126,
          "type": null,
          "body": "Doing the groundwork for a new builtin dissector that will call the protobuf dissector and requires the protobuf dissector to load the .proto file from a built-in location rather than require the user to configure the path via preferences.\n\n.proto files will be loaded from the global config and personal config 'protobuf' directories.\n\nI'm not sure if the current preference to set paths to directories is still required, but I'll leave it for now.",
